187
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:52,200
Smooth, multi-joint point mode applies smoothness to all joints.

188
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:57,200
The weight of all joints on each point is mixed with the weight of the corresponding point.

189
00:12:57,200 --> 00:13:03,200
