00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:51,200
When the panel is set to the right balance, you can use the copy to the right balance function to copy the balance value from one panel to the opposite panel.

230
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:59,200
This function allows you to quickly apply the same balance value, greatly reducing the time required to adjust the balance.

231
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:03,200
