332
00:24:01,200 --> 00:24:04,200
First, set the platform default to general.

333
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:09,200
The project will be deleted according to the selected platform type.

334
00:24:09,200 --> 00:24:14,200
In this tutorial, we will continue to refer to the general platform.

335
00:24:14,200 --> 00:24:18,200
