347
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:05,200
After all the selections are completed, click the Confirm button to start deleting.

348
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:10,200
After deleting, there will be a message that the file has been successfully deleted.

349
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:17,200
Click the Confirm button to clear all selected options.

350
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:24,200
